{"about_the_game":"Heroes of War is set in the Three Kingdoms period, and the game perfectly showcases 409 cities in 64 counties, 13 provinces, and 13 provinces of ancient China using 16 different terrains of 200000 grids. It also includes multiple exploration areas such as the four major foreign races, Japan, and Yizhou. Players can play as a faction and explore and simulate strategies through the world map, as well as engage in real-time battles with generals and troops on 23 different battlefield maps.<br />\r\nPlayers need to develop their power through internal, military, diplomatic and other means.<br />\r\nIn terms of domestic affairs, players need to build cities, recruit generals, develop the economy, and build defenses;<br />\r\nIn terms of military affairs, players need to cultivate generals, upgrade troops, occupy cities, use strategies, and engage in battlefield battles;<br />\r\nIn terms of diplomacy, players can form alliances, trade, and declare war with other forces.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2804290?t=1744170192","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744170192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744170192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744170192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Heroes of War is set in the Three Kingdoms period, and the game perfectly showcases 409 cities in 64 counties, 13 provinces, and 13 provinces of ancient China using 16 different terrains of 200000 grids. It also includes multiple exploration areas such as the four major foreign races, Japan, and Yizhou. Players can play as a faction and explore and simul